request reasons v1 "Reasons asked"
description "A request whose reject and send back say why (fictional rules): the machine refuses either with no comment, or with one of white space alone, and takes an approval with none"

use organization org from "../../examples/shared/company.ringi"
use calendar office from "../../examples/shared/office.cal"

form
  what : text "What"  count >=1 <=100

route
  first   manager
  decide  dept_head

who
  manager   = manager of requester
  dept_head = head of requester.department

every stage
  due in 3 business days at end of day
  when late expire
  when empty skip

ticket
  self approval     not allowed
  send back         to the requester, at most 2 times
  resubmit          within 3 business days
  comment required  for reject, send back

# Sent back with what to write, made again, approved with no comment, then rejected with why.
scenario sent_back_approved_and_rejected_with_reasons
  requester e1201
  form what = "A standing desk"
| at               | event                                    | by    | comment                           | -> stage | status         |
| 2026-11-16 10:00 | submit                                   | e1201 |                                   | first    | in progress    |
| 2026-11-16 11:00 | send back                                | e1101 | "Say which desk, please"          |          | with requester |
| 2026-11-16 12:00 | resubmit(what: "The desk by the window") | e1201 | "The one by the window"           | first    | in progress    |
| 2026-11-16 13:00 | approve                                  | e1101 |                                   | decide   | in progress    |
| 2026-11-16 14:00 | reject                                   | e3101 | "The budget of the year is spent" |          | rejected       |
